            "body_html": "\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis Jarrah Bee Pollen is harvested from pristine Jarrah Native Western Australian Forests, drawing nutrients from the ancient and rich Australian bush.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJarrah Bee Pollen is only available seasonally due to its availability.\u00a0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBee Pollen contains over 250 types of nutrients including vitamins, flavonoids, minerals, carbohydrates, lipids, amino acids \u0026amp; proteins\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eServing Suggestions\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSprinkle \u00bd - 1 teaspoon on cereal or yoghurt, add to smoothies, or effective, \u00a0directly under the tongue.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBee Pollen is best stored in the refrigerator to maintain it's crunch.\u00a0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNot recommended to be added to hot food or drinks.\u003c\/p\u003e",
